    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d714">

                <pb facs="0688" n="682" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg682"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Baron Ketteler to Mr.
                            Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >New York</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-08-17"><hi rendition="#italic">August 17,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>In reply to your inquiry, I am instructed to state that the Imperial Government,
                    in view of the peaceful situation at Apia, do not consider the dispatch of U. S.
                    S. <hi rendition="#italic">Philadelphia</hi> to Samoa to be of any further
                    necessity. An official answer to your note will be forwarded to-day.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ketteler.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
